{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1790,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alright here is the setup: I have a rifle\nmounted vertically and we're going to shoot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5970,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a bullet into this block, right into the middle\nof it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8580,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So obviously the block is going to go flying\ninto the air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11280,
    "dDurationMs": 3939,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But we're going to do this again and instead\nof firing the bullet right into the middle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15219,
    "dDurationMs": 4841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the block, we're going to shoot it off\nto one side and I want you to make a prediction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20060,
    "dDurationMs": 5530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Will that spinning block, when we shoot hit\nit to one side, will it go the same height"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25590,
    "dDurationMs": 1550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as this first block?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27140,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Will it go not as high?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29140,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or will it go higher?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30800,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK so versus being shot in the middle, when\nyou shoot on the side is the question, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34700,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35700,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How high will it go in comparison?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36800,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It depends on if the bullet stays in the block\n- and I'm assuming it does?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40370,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It does stay in the block, yes, I'll guarantee\nyou that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42790,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Same height."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43790,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm purely basing it on just like an instinct\nthat I have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47180,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel like I'm being tricked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48260,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just feel like you're trying to trick us\nand that it's going to do something that we"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51780,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can't predict."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52780,
    "dDurationMs": 3970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel like the obvious answer is not as high\nso I'm going to say higher."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56750,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll say higher, but it's going to like fly\nin a different direction or something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61530,
    "dDurationMs": 5010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you have angular momentum, which is L,\nand you have translational momentum, which"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66540,
    "dDurationMs": 3612,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is P. When you hit it in the middle of the\nblock, the block doesn't really spin at all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70152,
    "dDurationMs": 2178,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it just goes up to a certain height."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72330,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when you hit it on the side of the block,\nit's going to be spinning so it's going to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74570,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have imparted some kinetic energy so there\nwon't be as much potential energy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78680,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the total energy of the system basically\nhas to stay constant and the kinetic plus"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82920,
    "dDurationMs": 3550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "potential, which would be the height it goes\nto will have to be constant so if it's spinning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86470,
    "dDurationMs": 1829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it has kinetic energy, it can't go as high."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88299,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's my prediction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89299,
    "dDurationMs": 4401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So my prediction is it'll go up, not as high\nbut it'll spin more if it's hit to the side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93700,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Am I wrong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95650,
    "dDurationMs": 3710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want you to think which do you think is\nthe most reasonable and then click one of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99360,
    "dDurationMs": 2299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the annotations above."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101659,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alright are you ready?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103159,
    "dDurationMs": 5081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Make your prediction in three, two, one..."
    } ]
  } ]
}
